---
const enquiry = "mailto:velvetandpixel@gmail.com?subject=Project%20enquiry";
---

<section id="hire" class="wrap hire-section" aria-labelledby="hire-title">
  <div class="hire-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Available for focused, paid
      projects
    </p>
    <h2 id="hire-title">
      Custom apps.
      <br />
      <em>Less repetitive work.</em>
    </h2>
    <p class="hire-intro">
      Have a task you keep doing by hand, systems that don’t connect, or an app
      you want to build? Bring me the problem—you don’t need a finished
      specification.
    </p>
    <a class="button hire-quick-contact" href={enquiry}>
      Email me about a project{" "}
      <svg class="arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
        <path
          d="M4 16 16 4M4 4h12v12"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"
        />
      </svg>
    </a>
    <ul class="service-list">
      <li>Automate repetitive workflows and file processing.</li>
      <li>Turn scattered information into useful reports.</li>
      <li>Connect tools and services.</li>
      <li>Build internal tools and custom apps.</li>
      <li>Give useful software a polished, thoughtful interface.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Like the Velvet &amp; Pixel aesthetic? We can build with that
      personality—or create something that fits your own brand and users.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="hire-invite">
    <span class="eyebrow">Start with one useful project</span>
    <h3>
      What needs
      <br />
      <em>to work better?</em>
    </h3>
    <p>
      Tell me what you’re trying to accomplish, what happens today, and where it
      gets frustrating. We can discuss a manageable scope from there.
    </p>
    <p>A rough budget or deadline is helpful if you have one.</p>
    <a class="button" href={enquiry}>
      Email me about a project{" "}
      <svg class="arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
        <path
          d="M4 16 16 4M4 4h12v12"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"
        />
      </svg>
    </a>
    <a class="hire-email" href="mailto:velvetandpixel@gmail.com">
      velvetandpixel@gmail.com
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="developer-background">
    <p class="eyebrow">Engineering meets interface design</p>
    <h3>The developer behind the studio.</h3>
    <p>
      I’m Ilia, the developer behind Velvet &amp; Pixel. I have a computer
      science degree and a background in production engineering at DreamWorks
      Animation, working with Python, pipeline tools, state machines,
      integrations, and reliable workflows. I also own a tattoo shop, so I
      understand the practical demands of running a small business.
    </p>
    <p>
      My approach brings engineering and interface design together: useful tools
      that feel considered, clear, and distinctly yours.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
